     "design": {
      "purpose": "Evaluate expressions with parentheses nested inside brackets.",
      "principles": [
       "PRINCIPLE_SYSTEMATIC_VARIATION"
      ],
      "rationale": "Brackets add a second level of grouping, so students must work from the inside out. Each item has three operations, and the space under it holds one line per step. Writing each step keeps the order visible and makes errors easy to find.",
